  "decision_conditions": [
    "The proposal by virtue of its siting and appearance would result in an incongruous addition to the streetscene that would be visually intrusive and create visual clutter and it would not be in keeping with the character and appearance of the surrounding residential area. Furthermore, given the existing monopole outside Alexandra Drive Parade, the proposal would result in proliferation of such equipment, adversely affecting the existing street scene. Therefore, the proposal would not accord with policies CS8 and DM10 of the Council's adopted LDF Core Strategy April 2012."
